__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

results/*.jsonl
results/*.csv
results/*.json
!results/.gitkeep
figures/*.png
!figures/.gitkeep
reports/*.md
!reports/.gitkeep

requirements_lock.txt
gpu_info.txt
ADAMEM_COMMIT.txt

# diagnostics/ 是 Stage 0 的证据（成功率测量），属于实验记录的一部分，必须提交；
# results/ figures/ reports/ 仍然忽略：那些是每次运行都会被覆盖的中间产物。
!diagnostics/
!diagnostics/*.jsonl
!diagnostics/*.md
